866 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 368 0 R
/E (This query performs an exact point-lookup using the idx_student_name index, resulting in an access type of ref. Because it searches for one specific string \('Sara'\), MySQL jumps directly to that exact coordinate in the index tree without scanning surrounding entries. )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [10]
>>
