/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 385 0 R
/E (Inthislab, I created a school management website using PHP and MySQL. The database school_db stores the information in six related tables, and PHP reads and writes this data through SQL queries. The login system separates teachers and students, giving teachers full control over attendance, marks and student records, while students are limited to viewing the information. This lab helped me understand how a website connects to a database and how user roles can be used to protect data.)
/Pg 64 0 R
/K [2]
>>
